      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trudge/{size}/2062_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-07-08T02:49:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, the Greatest Legacy promo card got me wondering: which of the heroes were around during WW2 in some form, and could there be scenarios involving their battles?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It seems like there was a version of Bunker running around during WW2 (based on a card in the Time Cataclysm environement).&nbsp; Haka would have been alive during this time.&nbsp; The Argent Adept wouldn't have been alive yet, but there was likely some sort of Virtuoso of the Void.&nbsp; Am I missing anyone?&nbsp; Just how old is the Scholar?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What villains would have been around?&nbsp; Akosh'bhuta and Gloomweaver would both be around.&nbsp; So's Apostate, but I get the impression that he won't appear until after Fanatic does.&nbsp; What if the Matriarch wasn't the first person to wear that mask?&nbsp; Chairman Pike was alive at the time, but probably not directly involved...</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:47.576Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
