      "created_at": "2013-07-10T15:57:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you wanted a story fight, you could send people back to get Greatest Legacy to help them stop Iron Legacy, maybe run into omnitron while there. &nbsp;I'm going to assume that Legacy is GL's grand son, having him meet his grandfather would do a good job of shaming him.</p><p>I would absolutely love a WWII battlefield setting for a fight, land mines, artillery, bombing runs, insanity.</p>",
